<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 940 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 940 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural volume totaled 940 contracts versus 321 contracts traded overnight Tuesday.</p>
<p>There were 15 wheat, 345 corn, 536 soybean, 15 soymeal, 23 soyoil, five oat and one wheat call traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was steady, corn was steady to 1-1/4 cents lower and soybeans were 2-1/4 to 4-1/2 cents lower.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
